      "id": "claim_ca23c58ee7834432a08a4fe778e2d875",
      "statement": "For Illinois personal-lines property transactions subject to the bulletin, an insurer must make a clear, retainable water-backup disclosure available in connection with sale, issuance, or renewal and before the purchase decision; the disclosure must state whether coverage is included, optional, or unavailable and describe material limits, deductibles, exclusions, and conditions consistently with the policy.",
